This file keeps Coptic (U+2C80–U+2CFF), Demotic-derived letters
(U+03E2–U+03EF), combining marks (U+0300–U+036F including overline U+0305),
and the punctuation used in this project's Coptic strings.

Cmap probe on the upstream TTF and on this subset: U+2C80, U+2C81, U+03E2,
U+03EF, U+0304, U+0305 all present.

The Font-exception-2.0 in README applies to this subset as well.
